WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:03.758
"Be careful!" Roxy's mom said.

2
00:00:03.759 --> 00:00:06.562
Terrell and Dr. Odd were in robot suits.

3
00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:08.629
Bippo floated between them.

4
00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:13.412
"Bippo has a built-in portal projector," Dr. Odd said.

5
00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.283
"He can send us to Wukong's world."

6
00:00:16.284 --> 00:00:18.767
"Helpful, me!"

7
00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:22.374
"Then we'll find Wukong's friends," Terrell said.

8
00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:24.839
"They can bring us to Guanyin."

9
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:30.209
Dr. Odd's phone beeped. "Hello? Mayor Bloom!"

10
00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:34.090
"An earthquake knocked over a building," the mayor said.

11
00:00:34.091 --> 00:00:38.384
"I can't reach Rocket Girl. We need your big robot."

12
00:00:38.385 --> 00:00:44.356
"Oh dear!" Dr. Odd said. "I . . . I'm on my way!"

13
00:00:44.357 --> 00:00:48.727
"I'll go with you," Roxy's mom said. "I'm a doctor."

14
00:00:48.728 --> 00:00:52.475
"Wait! What about our mission?" Terrell said.

15
00:00:52.476 --> 00:00:56.826
"If we don't go, the earthquakes will cause even more damage."

16
00:00:56.827 --> 00:00:59.190
Dr. Odd nodded. "You're right.

17
00:00:59.191 --> 00:01:02.437
But people are in danger right now.

18
00:01:02.438 --> 00:01:04.815
Can you go by yourself?"

19
00:01:04.816 --> 00:01:10.601
Terrell gulped. "I never did a solo mission before," he thought.

20
00:01:10.602 --> 00:01:13.619
"I don't have super powers like Roxy."

21
00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.380
He remembered his conversation with the Tang Monk.

22
00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:20.665
The monk didn't have super powers, but he was helping lots of people.

23
00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:24.264
"Yes," Terrell said. "I can do it!"

24
00:01:24.265 --> 00:01:28.176
Bippo flew around him. "Partners, us!"

25
00:01:28.177 --> 00:01:34.579
Terrell laughed. "Okay, Bippo. I'm ready when you are!"

26
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:38.408
Bippo opened the portal.

27
00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:43.297
"Good luck!" Roxy's mom said as they stepped through.

28
00:01:43.298 --> 00:01:49.461
"Hmph!" the crocodile demon said. "I really wanted to live forever!"

29
00:01:49.462 --> 00:01:52.888
He and the plant demon sat in some dirty swamp water.

30
00:01:52.889 --> 00:01:58.404
"Yeah," the plant demon said. "That would've been great."

31
00:01:58.405 --> 00:02:01.825
A little demon came along. "What's wrong?"

32
00:02:01.826 --> 00:02:04.014
The plant demon sighed.

33
00:02:04.015 --> 00:02:08.155
"We were going to eat the Tang Monk and live forever."

34
00:02:08.156 --> 00:02:11.914
The little demon's eyes lit up. "Wonderful!"

35
00:02:11.915 --> 00:02:15.764
The crocodile demon snorted. "It's not wonderful.

36
00:02:15.765 --> 00:02:20.153
Sun Wukong chased us away." He made a fist.

37
00:02:20.154 --> 00:02:23.680
"I can't stand that monkey!"

38
00:02:23.681 --> 00:02:29.308
The little demon laughed. "Didn't you hear the good news?"

39
00:02:29.309 --> 00:02:33.801
The crocodile demon raised an eyebrow. "What good news?"

40
00:02:33.802 --> 00:02:37.155
"Sun Wukong is gone," the little demon said.

41
00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:39.965
"A mysterious figure took him away."

42
00:02:39.966 --> 00:02:43.822
The plant demon stood up. "Really?"

43
00:02:43.823 --> 00:02:47.569
The little demon nodded. "I know where the Tang Monk is."

44
00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:53.317
He frowned. "But I'm small. I can't fight his two friends."

45
00:02:53.318 --> 00:02:57.428
"Well, we're big." The crocodile demon stood up.

46
00:02:57.429 --> 00:03:00.271
"Show us where he is, little buddy.

47
00:03:00.272 --> 00:03:03.439
Then we'll all live forever!"

48
00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:08.326
The little demon jumped up and down. "Woo-hoo!"

49
00:03:08.327 --> 00:03:11.027
The three demons headed down a road.

50
00:03:11.028 --> 00:03:13.544
Soon they saw another demon.

51
00:03:13.545 --> 00:03:16.669
They hid behind a boulder.

52
00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:22.313
The little demon frowned. "That demon is big."

53
00:03:22.314 --> 00:03:25.023
"Yep," the crocodile demon said.

54
00:03:25.024 --> 00:03:28.349
"I'll bet he wants to eat the Tang Monk too."

55
00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.531
"I hope not," the plant demon said.

56
00:03:31.532 --> 00:03:34.987
"There won't be anything left for us!"

57
00:03:34.988 --> 00:03:37.207
"Lost, us!"

58
00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:40.062
"You're right, Bippo," Terrell said.

59
00:03:40.063 --> 00:03:43.945
They couldn't find Wukong's friends anywhere.

60
00:03:43.946 --> 00:03:46.311
The road took them through a swamp.

61
00:03:46.312 --> 00:03:49.964
They saw a hut, where three old men were working in a garden.

62
00:03:49.965 --> 00:03:52.150
When the men saw Terrell, they trembled.

63
00:03:52.151 --> 00:03:55.346
"Don't hurt us!" one cried.

64
00:03:55.347 --> 00:04:00.283
Terrell felt awful. "They think I'm a monster," he thought.

65
00:04:00.284 --> 00:04:02.612
He opened the robot's head and waved.

66
00:04:02.613 --> 00:04:04.313
The men came closer.

67
00:04:04.321 --> 00:04:08.884
"Hi," Terrell said. "I'm looking for the Tang Monk."

68
00:04:08.885 --> 00:04:11.116
The three men looked at one another.

69
00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:12.775
Then they looked at Terrell.

70
00:04:12.776 --> 00:04:16.379
"Didn't you hear?" one of the men said.

71
00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.670
"Sun Wukong is gone.

72
00:04:18.671 --> 00:04:23.945
The Tang Monk was captured by demons!"

